1. Document fonts embedded in the layout engine
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

These faces are compiled into `casual-doc-layout` with `include_bytes!`, so a
binary built from this repository carries their bytes. The one exception is
Roboto, whose four blobs the `external-web-fonts` WebAssembly build omits in
favour of faces the browser fetches; the files themselves are committed either
way. `crates/casual-doc-layout/fonts/README.md` records each file's provenance
and the role the font resolver gives it.

