4. Fonts fetched at runtime, which this repository does not redistribute
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The browser editor can load additional faces over the network at runtime --
Google Fonts, Noto and Noto CJK families, pinned by commit and fetched from a CDN
by `webapp/src/web_fonts.mjs`. Those files are not committed here and are not
redistributed by this repository, so they carry no attribution above; they are
distributed by their own publishers under their own licences, and each arrives
with the licence records in its own `name` table. A host that would rather serve
them itself supplies them through the font-registry seam instead.
